('MSG-TKT-2026-000032-003', 'TKT-2026-000032', 3, 'support_staff', 'REQ-000115', 'clarification_request', '2026-02-05T09:44:00', 'To make sure I give you the correct information, could you tell me exactly what you need: exam accommodation logistics, accommodation determination, assistive technology?'),
('MSG-TKT-2026-000032-004', 'TKT-2026-000032', 4, 'requester', 'REQ-000080', 'clarification_reply', '2026-02-05T10:31:00', 'Sorry for the confusion, my question is about exam accommodation logistics. How much extended exam time do I get?'),
('MSG-TKT-2026-000032-005', 'TKT-2026-000032', 5, 'support_staff', 'REQ-000115', 'agent_update', '2026-02-05T15:09:00', 'Quick update: your request is in progress, no action needed from you yet.'),
('MSG-TKT-2026-000032-006', 'TKT-2026-000032', 6, 'support_staff', 'REQ-000115', 'answer', '2026-02-06T11:33:00', 'Hi, Standard extended time is 50 percent of the regular exam length. Source: Exam accommodation logistics: Standard Procedure, version 2 (effective 2025-06-08).'),
('MSG-TKT-2026-000033-001', 'TKT-2026-000033', 1, 'requester', 'REQ-000068', 'question', '2026-02-05T16:14:00', 'I am confused about aid status and disbursement. Can someone explain how it works for me?'),
('MSG-TKT-2026-000033-002', 'TKT-2026-000033', 2, 'support_staff', 'REQ-000107', 'clarification_request', '2026-02-06T11:09:00', 'Could you clarify your question? Is it related to verification documents, aid status and disbursement, tuition payment and refunds?'),
('MSG-TKT-2026-000033-003', 'TKT-2026-000033', 3, 'requester', 'REQ-000068', 'clarification_reply', '2026-02-06T16:10:00', 'Sorry for the confusion, my question is about aid status and disbursement. How many credit hours do I need for my aid to be paid?'),
('MSG-TKT-2026-000033-004', 'TKT-2026-000033', 4, 'support_staff', 'REQ-000107', 'answer', '2026-02-10T10:25:00', 'Hello, Aid requires enrollment in at least 9 credit hours. Financial aid is disbursed 10 days after the term census date. Source: Aid status and disbursement: Standard Procedure, version 1 (effective 2025-08-14).'),
('MSG-TKT-2026-000034-001', 'TKT-2026-000034', 1, 'requester', 'REQ-000028', 'question', '2026-02-06T09:01:00', 'Could you tell me? How far ahead must I book an accommodated exam?'),
('MSG-TKT-2026-000034-002', 'TKT-2026-000034', 2, 'support_staff', 'REQ-000114', 'agent_update', '2026-02-06T09:38:00', 'We have picked up your case and are checking the details now.'),
('MSG-TKT-2026-000034-003', 'TKT-2026-000034', 3, 'support_staff', 'REQ-000114', 'answer', '2026-02-09T12:53:00', 'Thanks for your patience. Accommodated exams must be booked 3 days before the exam date. Standard extended time is 50 percent of the regular exam length. Source: Exam accommodation logistics: Standard Procedure, version 1 (effective 2024-05-21).'),
('MSG-TKT-2026-000035-001', 'TKT-2026-000035', 1, 'requester', 'REQ-000065', 'question', '2026-02-06T16:01:00', 'Hi team, How long do I have to file a progress appeal? I could not find it on the website.'),
('MSG-TKT-2026-000035-002', 'TKT-2026-000035', 2, 'support_staff', 'REQ-000106', 'answer', '2026-02-09T10:09:00', 'Hello, Progress appeals must be filed within 14 days of the notice. Minimum cumulative GPA for aid eligibility is 2.25. Source: Satisfactory progress appeal: Standard Procedure, version 2 (effective 2026-02-02).'),
('MSG-TKT-2026-000035-003', 'TKT-2026-000035', 3, 'support_staff', 'REQ-000106', 'agent_update', '2026-02-09T11:34:00', 'Update: we are completing your request in this office.'),
('MSG-TKT-2026-000035-004', 'TKT-2026-000035', 4, 'support_staff', 'REQ-000106', 'agent_update', '2026-02-11T09:55:00', 'We reviewed the request. we have approved the request and updated your record. Progress appeals must be filed within 14 days of the notice. Source: Satisfactory progress appeal: Standard Procedure, version 2 (effective 2026-02-02).'),
('MSG-TKT-2026-000036-001', 'TKT-2026-000036', 1, 'requester', 'REQ-000079', 'question', '2026-02-07T11:04:00', 'Could you tell me? How long is my account locked after failed sign-ins?'),
('MSG-TKT-2026-000036-002', 'TKT-2026-000036', 2, 'support_staff', 'REQ-000115', 'agent_update', '2026-02-07T13:52:00', 'Quick update: your request is in progress, no action needed from you yet.'),
('MSG-TKT-2026-000036-003', 'TKT-2026-000036', 3, 'support_staff', 'REQ-000115', 'answer', '2026-02-10T09:54:00', 'Thanks for your patience. Accounts lock for 30 minutes after five failed sign-ins. Source: Account, password and MFA: Standard Procedure, version 1 (effective 2025-05-24).'),
('MSG-TKT-2026-000037-001', 'TKT-2026-000037', 1, 'requester', 'REQ-000070', 'question', '2026-02-09T13:19:00', 'Could you tell me? How much extended exam time do I get?'),
('MSG-TKT-2026-000037-002', 'TKT-2026-000037', 2, 'support_staff', 'REQ-000110', 'answer', '2026-02-09T14:50:00', 'Thanks for your patience. Standard extended time is 50 percent of the regular exam length. Accommodated exams must be booked 5 days before the exam date. Source: Exam accommodation logistics: Standard Procedure, version 2 (effective 2025-06-08).'),
