('MSG-TKT-2026-000142-004', 'TKT-2026-000142', 4, 'support_staff', 'REQ-000112', 'clarification_request', '2026-06-29T16:37:00', 'Could you clarify your question? Is it related to lms and course access, wi-fi and software licenses, account, password and mfa?'),
('MSG-TKT-2026-000142-005', 'TKT-2026-000142', 5, 'requester', 'REQ-000091', 'clarification_reply', '2026-06-29T21:34:00', 'Like I said, I need help with my case.'),
('MSG-TKT-2026-000142-006', 'TKT-2026-000142', 6, 'support_staff', 'REQ-000112', 'clarification_request', '2026-06-30T09:29:00', 'Thanks for reaching out. So I can point you to the right policy, which topic is this about: account, password and mfa, security incident, lms and course access?'),
('MSG-TKT-2026-000142-007', 'TKT-2026-000142', 7, 'requester', 'REQ-000091', 'requester_followup', '2026-06-30T20:36:00', 'Any update on this?'),
('MSG-TKT-2026-000142-008', 'TKT-2026-000142', 8, 'support_staff', 'REQ-000112', 'escalation_note', '2026-07-01T13:29:00', 'Escalating to the Platform Administration because the question is still unclear after two clarification attempts.'),
('MSG-TKT-2026-000142-009', 'TKT-2026-000142', 9, 'support_staff', 'REQ-000122', 'handoff_response', '2026-07-04T13:57:00', 'Decision from the Platform Administration: we have granted a one-time exception and recorded it on your file.'),
('MSG-TKT-2026-000143-001', 'TKT-2026-000143', 1, 'requester', 'REQ-000076', 'question', '2026-06-30T19:45:00', 'How early do course shells open? Thanks in advance.'),
