('MSG-TKT-2026-000144-001', 'TKT-2026-000144', 1, 'requester', 'REQ-000058', 'question', '2026-07-02T09:45:00', 'How long do I have to submit my verification documents? Thanks in advance.'),
('MSG-TKT-2026-000144-002', 'TKT-2026-000144', 2, 'support_staff', 'REQ-000105', 'answer', '2026-07-02T12:12:00', 'Hi, Verification documents are due within 21 days of the request notice. Submitted documents are reviewed within 15 business days. Source: Verification documents: Standard Procedure, version 2 (effective 2025-07-05).'),
('MSG-TKT-2026-000145-001', 'TKT-2026-000145', 1, 'requester', 'REQ-000063', 'question', '2026-07-02T12:52:00', 'Hi team, How much does an official transcript cost? I could not find it on the website.'),
('MSG-TKT-2026-000145-002', 'TKT-2026-000145', 2, 'support_staff', 'REQ-000108', 'answer', '2026-07-06T14:08:00', 'Good news, I found the relevant policy. Each official transcript costs 10 USD. Source: Transcripts and records: Standard Procedure, version 2 (effective 2026-06-13).'),
('MSG-TKT-2026-000146-001', 'TKT-2026-000146', 1, 'requester', 'REQ-000023', 'question', '2026-07-04T14:42:00', 'Need help with the thing we discussed last term.'),
('MSG-TKT-2026-000146-002', 'TKT-2026-000146', 2, 'support_staff', 'REQ-000105', 'clarification_request', '2026-07-06T13:54:00', 'To make sure I give you the correct information, could you tell me exactly what you need: tuition payment and refunds, aid status and disbursement, satisfactory progress appeal?'),
('MSG-TKT-2026-000146-003', 'TKT-2026-000146', 3, 'requester', 'REQ-000023', 'clarification_reply', '2026-07-06T15:13:00', 'I am not sure, it is complicated and I cannot explain it better.'),
