('MSG-TKT-2026-000146-005', 'TKT-2026-000146', 5, 'support_staff', 'REQ-000105', 'escalation_note', '2026-07-09T09:22:00', 'Escalating to the Academic Administration Office because the question is still unclear after two clarification attempts.'),
('MSG-TKT-2026-000146-006', 'TKT-2026-000146', 6, 'support_staff', 'REQ-000117', 'handoff_response', '2026-07-10T13:49:00', 'After specialist review: we cannot approve this request as submitted; the policy terms apply.'),
('MSG-TKT-2026-000147-001', 'TKT-2026-000147', 1, 'requester', 'REQ-000059', 'question', '2026-07-06T09:15:00', 'I am confused about account, password and mfa. Can someone explain how it works for me?'),
('MSG-TKT-2026-000147-002', 'TKT-2026-000147', 2, 'system', NULL, 'system_ack', '2026-07-06T09:18:00', 'Your request TKT-2026-000147 was received and routed to the IT Help Desk. Keep this reference for follow-ups.'),
('MSG-TKT-2026-000147-003', 'TKT-2026-000147', 3, 'support_staff', 'REQ-000113', 'clarification_request', '2026-07-06T10:54:00', 'To make sure I give you the correct information, could you tell me exactly what you need: lms and course access, wi-fi and software licenses, security incident?'),
('MSG-TKT-2026-000147-004', 'TKT-2026-000147', 4, 'requester', 'REQ-000059', 'clarification_reply', '2026-07-06T19:07:00', 'It is about account, password and mfa. Specifically: How often do I have to change my password?'),
('MSG-TKT-2026-000147-005', 'TKT-2026-000147', 5, 'support_staff', 'REQ-000113', 'answer', '2026-07-07T10:47:00', 'Hi, Passwords expire every 180 days. Accounts lock for 30 minutes after five failed sign-ins. Source: Account, password and MFA: Standard Procedure, version 1 (effective 2025-05-24).'),
('MSG-TKT-2026-000148-001', 'TKT-2026-000148', 1, 'requester', 'REQ-000040', 'question', '2026-07-06T16:02:00', 'Hello, quick question: When is the last day to withdraw with a W grade?'),
('MSG-TKT-2026-000148-002', 'TKT-2026-000148', 2, 'support_staff', 'REQ-000108', 'agent_update', '2026-07-07T12:28:00', 'We have picked up your case and are checking the details now.'),
('MSG-TKT-2026-000148-003', 'TKT-2026-000148', 3, 'support_staff', 'REQ-000108', 'answer', '2026-07-08T13:29:00', 'Hello, Withdrawal with a W grade is allowed through day 60 of the term. Courses may be added through day 5 of the term. Source: Add, drop and withdraw: Standard Procedure, version 3 (effective 2025-08-27).'),
('MSG-TKT-2026-000148-004', 'TKT-2026-000148', 4, 'requester', 'REQ-000040', 'thanks', '2026-07-12T20:45:00', 'Thanks, that resolves it.'),
