('MSG-TKT-2026-000149-003', 'TKT-2026-000149', 3, 'support_staff', 'REQ-000107', 'answer', '2026-07-09T16:18:00', 'Thanks for your patience. Verification documents are due within 21 days of the request notice. Submitted documents are reviewed within 15 business days. Source: Verification documents: Standard Procedure, version 2 (effective 2025-07-05).'),
